er focus and device-following glyph legends.\",","+    \"Knowing what exists in a very large API: the index is huge, so finding the right call (toCell's return shape, mouseGround, input.held) took grepping and small experiments.\",","+    \"The error reporting that dedupes repeated errors: it hides how often something fails, which misled my first tests; I would overhaul it to keep a count per message.\",","+    \"Built-in chorded mouse button support (and a documented way to read raw gamepad axes for a second stick), so watch-and-shoot schemes work with a mouse out of the box.\"","+  ],","+  \"promptFeedback\": [","+    \"It asks for a complete vertical slice with real infrastructure (attract mode, AI Hub, controller-first UX, an About screen) rather than a toy, and the plan it came with was specific enough to build from.\",","+    \"The plan targeted a 60-75 minute five-episode game with a different file name and model; at medium effort scoping that down while keeping every system was a judgment call the prompt leaves open.\",","+    \"Fitting every system (field surveillance, chase, tail, box, cipher, affidavit and judge, wire room, the corner as Tee, versus with networking, attract) into one coherent, working build in a single session.\",","+    \"A real human playthrough of the full story on a TV with a DualSense, start to credits, to judge pacing and readability at 10 feet.\"","+  ],","+  \"aiHub\": {","+    \"name\": \"WIRETAP\",","+    \"tagline\": \"Somebody's always listening.\",","+    \"description\": \"Work both sides of a West Baltimore corner in 2004: build a wiretap case one photo, page and phone call at a time, then run the corner the case is built on. Includes a 1-4 player cops-vs-corner versus mode.\",","+    \"type\": \"Game\",","+    \"genre\": \"Stealth\",","+    \"source\": \"The Wire (2002-2008)\",","+    \"series\": \"\",","+    \"players\": \"1–4\",","+    \"controls\": \"Stick/WASD move · L2/right mouse watch · R2/left click photo · Cross/E interact · Triangle/Q partner, orders, call out · Create/Tab notebook\",","+    \"tags\": [","+      \"story\",","+      \"versus\",","+      \"pixel art\",","+      \"isometric\",","+      \"crime\",","+      \"stealth\"","+    ]","+  }"," }"]}]}],"moreFiles":1,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-125818__x600c07/agent.4.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-125818__x600c07/work/Wiretap-TheWire-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-125818.html","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-125818__x600c07/work/Wiretap-TheWire-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-125818/dev-bundle.js","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-125818__x600c07/work/Wiretap-TheWire-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-125818/src/credits.json","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-125818__x600c07/work/exit-interview.json","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-125815__x600c07/agent.4.out"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01N89MDTu11P1pimrxzQMKJ8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
